{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8","evidence_type":"contextual_fact","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2a06be54291ad8e8f48a45d77c98c1e318aeb3d4daae34bf4cbe4d91e04c33c8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"code-inspected","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"strands-agents/harness-sdk@08ed4cfd3eb4 snapshot 2ada8cfbc7de393b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3de260023080f2c1f94c841d07f3f9a9a460ea34e6dde76462990d5ca4837e91","slc_736580b3d71b2c62053222ba95989218aab805364f8677a53468a70bb3d2ab55","slc_c1f67093f1f366096fe768f9d25ec9da8435ca43a08f986ad9102716dba54960","slc_ffef8fee2125987ee76654a70143c302022e1291c2499428b9340bf0dc0c7cc0"],"source_ids":["src_e6e3f52a46b35cb0993f81c369d14447"],"text":"Delegation enforces a single-call constraint (a delegation tool must be the only tool called in a turn, otherwise the call is cancelled or an error result is returned), and the agent loop exits via end_turn after a successful delegation whose content becomes the final assistant message.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3a98356aa9a0390d66d4c63dd8d9fa696be1cfbbeef5b30500eb0b712d42d176","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"strands-agents/harness-sdk@08ed4cfd3eb4 snapshot 2ada8cfbc7de393b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_835f8164bd9b4bd9a718b6a54c9bd349654f7359ed66affcba89a34e00f3a644","slc_8c4f8cb404585c5e4be43f4a733ea9b0da7c8abad9ee35144f94a0554bea2701","slc_fa6a31f9d786331d4d4808ece378b3d4cfb707504832f8f6acc196e648ac6e68","slc_ffd9efff371f6c0c8b327bc6bdc50147323538aae3ffa7abbb8e9f8720719fad"],"source_ids":["src_7e796086bcac5249b6de15675759c2b8"],"text":"The Python SDK requires Python 3.10+ and is installed via pip as strands-agents (with strands-agents-tools); the TypeScript SDK requires Node.js 22+ and installs as @strands-agents/sdk via npm.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_46a8396e4030180a315d9c65774de6117a253a280d6d23af1fbd8521578fbedc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"strands-agents/harness-sdk@08ed4cfd3eb4 snapshot 2ada8cfbc7de393b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5aea7838fe8b014af3b1d859cdf46db64d3350d18ca4b23eb0d774846ef2f039","slc_9ac50f0380cda49448f98586b39b7a30bea21fcf4c4e9d490492b4fc052abe51","slc_d0c01d742f7b9be28a46133928fccdd922aa5506cf788a6eab90ea7c1bcdc043","slc_f307d6dbf568861b039c166ecc7bb8545f60e8330dee61406c3d6e31e50cb025"],"source_ids":["src_7e796086bcac5249b6de15675759c2b8"],"text":"Repository development practice: Python SDK tests and formatting run via hatch test and hatch fmt in strands-py; the TypeScript SDK uses npm ci, npm run build, and npm test; the docs site runs with npm install and npm run dev in site/; git operations are done from the repo root.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4bd8d53a4df2a3ec99c5caa037f41288f05c956b7434d534e7e8e4669fe27945","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"strands-agents/harness-sdk@08ed4cfd3eb4 snapshot 2ada8cfbc7de393b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c737752ce4b17d8f647dc9115f0f6dd8e260809df6429968b411b243463ae6cf"],"source_ids":["src_7e796086bcac5249b6de15675759c2b8"],"text":"Both SDKs default to the Amazon Bedrock model provider, requiring AWS credentials and model access for Claude Sonnet; other providers such as Anthropic, OpenAI, Gemini, and Ollama are covered in the quickstart.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_646bd25c7f63e549dce0ac55906b43a46502b798d23189b28a3844207e9c9fd2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"strands-agents/harness-sdk@08ed4cfd3eb4 snapshot 2ada8cfbc7de393b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1ec896a6cfac9ce1d5f2fa5b8602bae6c9c95cff101431285bfa1469e587f988","slc_645f502b68b3ed0854a15273547c280537e4d6020d6c278175c871e243975548","slc_be3e9e21a47aaf1fcce9343cad9c1799c09df2cb20e48f7c015bdcb01fa5408b","slc_f1b2a3618f62387937bb6ece1b71b5e32cd791aa6bab80494357442fc8773bcc"],"source_ids":["src_1967c375194651cfb5f12e5b6f29c0c0"],"text":"The agent loop invokes the model, executes requested tools, feeds results back, and repeats until a final response; tool failures are returned to the model as error results rather than terminating the loop, and conversation history accumulates across iterations with a conversation manager keeping it within the context window.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8","evidence_type":"contextual_fact","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_76494216b2d9638e21f750b10066da8acd7f6a890011b1feaa16f3cce557a0af","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"code-inspected","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"strands-agents/harness-sdk@08ed4cfd3eb4 snapshot 2ada8cfbc7de393b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_73966bdad85e46f0aa79d562a365ed75e719618aefb6131b87beb884160e5269","slc_fdebbd927fa4ee5fc0cc93e4edb8ee5c82bdeec97af140592ee61d9335dcf7df"],"source_ids":["src_e6e3f52a46b35cb0993f81c369d14447"],"text":"Delegation is incompatible with stateful models: initialization raises ValueError if a delegate=True tool is registered on a stateful model, and at execution time delegation is skipped and the tool runs normally, because early loop exit would leave unclosed function calls server-side.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7e4f4ea495565e041471b73b7d868344c1a26582855938dd2fa51fd992be0330","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"strands-agents/harness-sdk@08ed4cfd3eb4 snapshot 2ada8cfbc7de393b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5092e530ed8a287ed995ba095c41255b67dd24362d681b1eae5fb58b8197d488","slc_7e523f848b8d090e9d1fd0f82a4ebc799d7538cbbd2a4ef2002f6aa2908666e3"],"source_ids":["src_7e796086bcac5249b6de15675759c2b8"],"text":"Repository development practice: contributions are guided by CONTRIBUTING.md covering bug reports, development setup, pull requests, code of conduct, and security issue reporting; doc PRs are welcome alongside code changes.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8","evidence_type":"contextual_fact","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9580442f7fc4e840858ffa1cd5551b7f22ed7e7273464f6853da9283fae8ad03","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"code-inspected","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"strands-agents/harness-sdk@08ed4cfd3eb4 snapshot 2ada8cfbc7de393b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d580a95e5d15e63ae3587a4e5053b943f860a5578cf8df2e48fff13453ef11ef","slc_fb9472bdbd81cbb5ea456a4ede12e08d138104911736318e5ca6e34a15012b42"],"source_ids":["src_e6e3f52a46b35cb0993f81c369d14447"],"text":"Delegation end_turn is skipped when the parent agent expects structured output or when the delegation tool result has no meaningful (blank) content.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ae57a5994f8bd2176772555ecdf0981db5d22912e45b959a8abfa1862f9a4947","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"strands-agents/harness-sdk@08ed4cfd3eb4 snapshot 2ada8cfbc7de393b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d4662dfda09b0e27eb6d61851d819c78fc55355d23af737f93665b244c20d565"],"source_ids":["src_7e796086bcac5249b6de15675759c2b8"],"text":"The SDK advertises built-in lifecycle controls (turn limits, token budgets, cancellation, stop reasons), tools, structured output, MCP, multi-agent patterns, memory, sessions, model portability, streaming, guardrails, tracing, and evals.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b075c076ac554db140a78adcf2bd371507ad8240b1d94d004525cb90d964d5d7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"strands-agents/harness-sdk@08ed4cfd3eb4 snapshot 2ada8cfbc7de393b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1b1c5174376c13b6d217eef82d2641df1dd95e9b9d2c76bc8c4eb3be981defff","slc_32b2593378fc30f3814a133543557b57c52a1904be69db29ced7fd365401ba7f","slc_4487206f9f3a842b13fe1f17d2af3dfdafaf9007854f5db7e63ee44bac52efa4","slc_78ad7742710e5fd200be7de853d059c81ec7b7fba15bb27dfec167ec9d58200c"],"source_ids":["src_7e796086bcac5249b6de15675759c2b8"],"text":"The Python API exposes an Agent class constructed with a tools list and invoked by calling it with a prompt string; the TypeScript API exposes an Agent with an awaitable invoke(prompt) method.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8","evidence_type":"contextual_fact","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ced4324c96d04c991d28f75a9df6b3e8cc81e9f67d46374b993bf22e9b2ef2d3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"code-inspected","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"strands-agents/harness-sdk@08ed4cfd3eb4 snapshot 2ada8cfbc7de393b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4852f5d8fc2236548e5de0d26443f2f791211a771fa62fd4679c440a32af9e72","slc_a911a34370cacd52df169dd771f4c4629dfde0514b695a90a3539d83c5e6268f","slc_b7b8f94d308ec161864f1d7d6f6650b3638ae5d4dae411810caa2aa5ee4934d0","slc_fcec88d49481b104b934135a46fc5c248be7ebd5fbe3785eb0b97aa1b2630f5a"],"source_ids":["src_e6e3f52a46b35cb0993f81c369d14447"],"text":"The Python SDK includes an AgentDelegation plugin (auto-registered on every agent) that enforces delegation semantics for tools configured with delegate=True, acting as a no-op when no delegation tools fire.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e0599e473447529d8f7f81d8e0075ac5edc80ef89a63fe309fef74685d4b5d1f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"strands-agents/harness-sdk@08ed4cfd3eb4 snapshot 2ada8cfbc7de393b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d4662dfda09b0e27eb6d61851d819c78fc55355d23af737f93665b244c20d565"],"source_ids":["src_7e796086bcac5249b6de15675759c2b8"],"text":"Strands Agents is an open-source SDK for building and running AI agents in Python and TypeScript, positioned as a replacement for a hand-rolled agent loop that runs in the user's process with no hosted control plane.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","created_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_fa43c72c94be5d058e1fd1403c454b534cd48de3fdb1317a5602006a86dcef5e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"strands-agents/harness-sdk@08ed4cfd3eb4 snapshot 2ada8cfbc7de393b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_14e77679bd25688fbcc2b47ef472b646f6607bd2a50a1ad7eb5e723bb06189e7","slc_665b969ae5a3302de559fe11ca0f7d9b227f18e4e01b3709de87c38d84687862"],"source_ids":["src_7e796086bcac5249b6de15675759c2b8"],"text":"The monorepo contains strands-py (Python SDK), strands-ts (TypeScript SDK), site (Astro/Starlight documentation site), and team (governance and cross-SDK process docs including designs/ proposals).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:23:42Z","updated_by_operation":"op_65bb8c259863400b9f3c134241317dd8"}
